        <Thesaurus:P325 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Refers to the amount of a protein made in a cell. The study of protein expression in cancer cells may give information about a specific type of cancer, the best treatment to use, and how well a treatment works.</Thesaurus:P325>
        <Thesaurus:P366 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Protein_Expression</Thesaurus:P366>
