        <Thesaurus:P97 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Used to denote the transcription of DNA into RNA.  The biochemical machinery includes sequence-specific DNA binding proteins that directly act in the regulation of the transcription process, other protein factors that participate in the assembly of the transcription complex, and RNA polymerase.</Thesaurus:P97>
        <Thesaurus:code rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">C19018</Thesaurus:code>
        <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">RNA Synthesis</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


