        <ad-ontology-merged:P207>C0332307</ad-ontology-merged:P207>
        <ad-ontology-merged:P322>CareLex</ad-ontology-merged:P322>
        <ad-ontology-merged:P325>Something distinguishable as an identifiable class based on common qualities.[NCI]</ad-ontology-merged:P325>
