        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">We are assuming that every molecular entity has to be completely connected by chemical bonds. This excludes protein complexes, which are comprised of minimally two separate molecular entities. We will follow up with Chebi to ensure this is their understanding as well</obo:IAO_0000116>
