        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A narrow and shallow incision into soil resulting from erosion by overland flow that has been focused into a thin thread by soil surface roughness. Rilling, the process of rill formation, is common on agricultural land and unvegetated ground.</owl:annotatedTarget>
