        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A vivarium is an enclosure for keeping and raising organisms for observation or research. Often, a portion of the ecosystem for a particular species is simulated on a smaller scale, with controls for environmental conditions.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vivarium</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
