        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The marine abyssal zone biome comprises regions of the marine benthic biome  between approximately 2500 m and 6000 m depth. This zone generally coincides with the continental rise and the abyssal plain.</owl:annotatedTarget>
