        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A dense settlement biome is an anthropogenic terrestrial biome which is primarily used for human habitation, recreation, and industry within built structures with little other land use.</owl:annotatedTarget>
