        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A hydrothermal seep is a seep in which diffuse flow of geothermally heated fluids with high methane concentrations. This seep has been proposed as an intermediate between cold seeps and hydrothermal vents.</owl:annotatedTarget>
