        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A liquid chromatography mass spectrometry platform is a platform that is the collection of instrument, software and reagents needed to perform a liquid chromatography mass spectrometry protocol. definition_source: OBI.</obo:IAO_0000115>
