        <obo:IAO_0000111 xml:lang="en">unplanned occurrence effecting an investigation</obo:IAO_0000111>
        <obo:IAO_0000112 xml:lang="en">Earthquake that destroys the lab, an outside investigator discovering an adverse effect of the reagants used</obo:IAO_0000112>
