        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">a reference role in which the characteristics or responses elicited by the substance playing the reference substance role are used to establish a &quot;no effect&quot; response</obo:IAO_0000115>
