to be used in an investigation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Jennifer Fostel</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Jennifer Fostel</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000232 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">5/31/2012: A supplying process implies that there is an acquisition process. These may need to be tied together, so that modeling either way is reciprocal.</obo:IAO_0000232>
        <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">supplying</rdfs:label>
