        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A process in which is the end of life of animal is brought about in accordance with local regulations on treatment of animal subjects and using a method which causes minimal pain and distress to the animal subject</obo:IAO_0000115>
