        <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">03/21/2010: Added to allow classification of children (similar to what we want to do for &apos;measurement device&apos;. Lookint at what classifies here, we may want to reconsider a contain function assigned to a part of an entity is necessarily also a function of the whole (e.g. is a centrifuge a container because it has test tubes as parts?)</obo:IAO_0000116>
