        <obo:IAO_0000112 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Screening a libray of M13 phages displaying random peptide sequences for binding to the MHC molecule HLA-A*02:02 resulting in a subset of phages that encode peptides that bind.</obo:IAO_0000112>
