        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Phage display library panning is a process in which a diverse collection of phages encoding peptides or proteins are screened and the ones encoding active peptides/proteins are selected in an iterative process similar to natural selection.</obo:IAO_0000115>
