        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A freezing process by which material entities are quickly frozen by subjecting them to cryogenic temperatures, or in direct contact with Liquid nitrogen at -320.8F or -196°C.</obo:IAO_0000115>
