        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An assay to capture the location of open chromatin, DNA-binding proteins, individual nucleosomes and chromatin compaction at nucleotide resolution by Tn5 transposase insertion.</obo:IAO_0000115>
