        <obo:IAO_0000112 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Csorba et al., (November 2014). &quot;Antisense COOLAIR mediates the coordinated switching of chromatin states at FLC during vernalization.&quot; Proc Natl Acad Sci 111(45):16160-5. doi: 10.1073/pnas.1419030111.</obo:IAO_0000112>
