        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A detection of specific nucleic acids with complementary probes to discover regions of the genome which are bound by a specific RNA (or a by a ribonucleoprotein containing the RNA of interest) using high-throughput sequencing.</obo:IAO_0000115>
