        <obo:IAO_0000119 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Chu et al. (31 August 2011). &quot;Genomic Maps of Long Noncoding RNA Occupancy Reveal Principles of RNA-Chromatin Interactions&quot;. Molecular Cell.</obo:IAO_0000119>
