        <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2010-01-31 Philippe Rocca-Serra: restriction now changed to be the output of a digital curation process + reflected in example of usage and reference</obo:IAO_0000116>
