        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Determination of the grade (severity/stage) of a tumor sample, used in cancer biology to describe abnormalities/qualities of tumor cells or tissues. Values can be described by terms from NCI Thesaurus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
