        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000111 xml:lang="en">nucleic acid extraction</obo:IAO_0000111>
        <obo:IAO_0000112 xml:lang="en">Phenol / chlorophorm extraction disolvation of protein content folllowed by ethanol precipitation of the nucleic acid fraction over night in the fridge followed by centrifugation to obtain a nucleic acid pellet.</obo:IAO_0000112>
