            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000111 xml:lang="en">peptide construct</obo:IAO_0000111>
        <obo:IAO_0000112 xml:lang="en">Multiple Antigenic Peptide (MAP) construct containing T and B cell epitopes from p. falciparum congugated to a central glycin

A novel multivalent human CTL peptide construct elicits robust cellular immune responses in HLA-A*0201 transgenic mice: implications for HTLV-1 vaccine design. Vaccine. 2003 Jun 20;21(21-22):2767-81. PMID: 12798617</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000114 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">a material entity synthesized to contain a number of peptides conjugated together in a non-linear fashion</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117 xml:lang="en">PERSON: Bjoern Peters</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000119 xml:lang="en">IEDB</obo:IAO_0000119>
