        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An embryo that is at the late embryonic stage; this stage covers late steps of the embryogenesis with a fully formed embryo still developing before birth or egg hatching.</obo:IAO_0000115>
