        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Muscle tissue which is unstriated, composed primarily of smooth muscle fibers surrounded by a reticulum of collagen and elastic fibers. Smooth muscle differs from striated muscle in the much higher actin/myosin ratio, the absence of conspicuous sarcomeres and the ability to contract to a much smaller fraction of its resting length[GO].</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">involuntary muscle</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
