        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A compound tubular submucosal gland found in that portion of the duodenum which is above the hepatopancreatic sphincter (Sphincter of Oddi). The main function of these glands is to produce a mucus-rich alkaline secretion (containing bicarbonate)[WP].</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Brunner&apos;s gland</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
