        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The secretory units of the exocrine pancreas, where fluid containing digestive enzymes is produced; consists of a group of secretory cells surrounding a luminal space that connects to the pancreatic duct.</obo:IAO_0000115>
