        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Subdivision of skeleton that is the collection of all skeletal elements in a manus, which is the distal section of the anterior forelimb skeleton consisting of the mesopodium, the metapodium and the acropodium (e.g. including the wrist, palm, and fingers)[Phenoscape].</obo:IAO_0000115>
