        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Cranial nerves are nerves that emerge directly from the brain, in contrast to spinal nerves, which emerge from segments of the spinal cord.</obo:IAO_0000115>
