        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A paired appendage that is evolved from a paired fin. The extent of this structure includes autopod, stylopod and zeugopod regions when present, but excludes the girdle and its parts.</obo:IAO_0000115>
