        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A (free) limb that is connected to a pectoral girdle. The extent of this structure includes autopod, stylopod and zeugopod regions when present, but excludes the pectoral girdle and its parts.</obo:IAO_0000115>
