        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The dorsal roots contain afferent sensory axons. The dorsal roots of each side continue outwards, along the way forming a dorsal root ganglion (also called a spinal ganglion).</obo:IAO_0000115>
