        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The layer of connective tissue comprised of the endometrial lining of the uterus which fluctuates in thickness throughout the menstrual cycle.</obo:IAO_0000115>
