        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An area of conducting tissue between the atria and the ventricles of the heart that conducts the normal electrical impulse from the atria to the ventricles.</obo:IAO_0000115>
