        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A large sesamoid bone found in the distal femur/proximal tibial region of the hindlimb of tetrapods. The patella is the attachment site for proximal hindlimb tendons.[PHENOSCAPE:ad]</obo:IAO_0000115>
