        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The lymph nodes located in the mesentery, of which there are 3 classes: ileocolic, juxtaintestinal mesenteric, and central superior group.</obo:IAO_0000115>
