        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Anatomical structure that has as its parts two or more multi-tissue structures of at least two different types and which through specific morphogenetic processes forms a single distinct structural unit demarcated by bona fide boundaries from other distinct anatomical structures of different types.</obo:IAO_0000115>
