        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A collection of teeth arranged in some pattern in the mouth or other part of the body. The arrangement may be a simple row, a collection of rows, or a more elaborate structure, such as a toooth whorl.</obo:IAO_0000115>
