        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The tissues that surround the organs that are present within the abdominal cavity. The abdominal wall tissue is composed of layers of fat, parietal peritoneum, fascia, and muscles.</obo:IAO_0000115>
