        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A saclike structure of the prostate gland, comprised of at least three cell layers: an innermost layer of secretory columnar luminal epithelium, a middle layer of squamous basal epithelium that also contains neuroendocrine cells, transit amplifying cells, and stem cells, and an outer layer of smooth muscle intermixed with other stromal cells</obo:IAO_0000115>
