        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The inner stripe is a deep, centrally located portion of the renal outer medulla and is traversed by thick and thin portions of nephron tubules</obo:IAO_0000115>
