        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A ring of fibrous or fibrocartilaginous tissue (as of an intervertebral disk or surrounding an orifice of the heart).</obo:IAO_0000115>
